==Etymology==
Benzarro's name is a parody of the [[Wikipedia:DC Comics|DC Comics]] villain [[Wikipedia:Bizarro|Bizarro]], an evil clone of [[Wikipedia:Superman|Superman]].

==Trivia==
*Since Benzarro is an undead being, any alien that is not naturally an undead being would be zombified versions if Benzarro uses them.{{Refn|[[:File:Benzarro Has Zombie Aliens.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
*Benzarro likes his fries with clods of dirt and worms, and makes his smoothies with paste.{{Refn|[[:File:Alternate Ben Food Preferences.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
*[[Derrick J. Wyatt]]'s favorite alternate Ben was either [[Nega Ben]] or Benzarro. However, his favorites changed depending on his mood.{{Refn|[[:File:DJW Favorite Ben.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
*The scope of the zombie outbreak in Benzarro's reality is unknown.{{Refn|group = DJW|[[:File:Unknown Zombie Virus Scope.png]]}}
*Benzarro's [[Earth (Classic)|Earth]] has bite marks and square tires.{{Refn|group = DJW|[[:File:Benzarro Earth.png]]}}
*Benzarro's version of [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]] is an unpowered scientist constantly working on a cure for Benzarro from a secure secret bunker.{{Refn|group = DJW|name = gwen}}
*Derrick J. Wyatt believed that Benzarro's aliens' names end in "zarro".{{Refn|[[:File:Benzarro Way Big Proof.png]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Benzarro Upgrade Proof.PNG]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Benzarro Bloxx Proof.png]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Benzarro Goop Proof.png]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Benzarro Stinkfly Proof.png]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Benzarro Whampire Proof.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Derrick J. Wyatt believed that Benzarro's version of [[Max Tennyson (Classic)|Max]] isn't around anymore.{{Refn|[[:File:Max is Not Around in Benzarro Timeline.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Benzarro's version of [[Dr. Animo (Classic)|Dr. Animo]] is one of the few scientists left and is trying to save the world.{{Refn|[[:File:Benzarro Animo.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
*Benzarro's version of [[Zombozo (Classic)|Zombozo]] is one of the few remaining humans{{Refn|[[:File:Benzarro Zombozo.PNG]]|group = DJW}} and is enemies with Benzarro.{{Refn|[[:File:Benzarro Zombozo Enemies With Ben.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
*Benzarro's versions of [[Captain Nemesis]]{{Refn|[[:File:Benzarro Captain Nemesis.png]]|group = DJW}} and [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]]{{Refn|[[:File:Benzarro Kevin.PNG]]|group = DJW}} are currently listed as missing.
*The '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''' crew did not specify the nature of the zombie outbreak in Benzarro's dimension.{{Refn|[[:File:Benzarro Dimension Zombie Outbreak Unspecified Nature.png]]|group = CM}}
*During the show's run, [[Derrick J. Wyatt]] created an unofficial concept with his friend Clover Karin imagining Benzarro as a scientist who used his cousin Gwen as a test subject for the zombie outbreak and ended up getting infected himself.{{Refn|https://archive.is/F4w4m|group = CK}}

